WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.666 --> 00:00:05.669
(Tywin): As Aerys Targaryen's behavior
grew more and more erratic,

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:10.670
the task of ruling the Seven Kingdoms
fell to me, Tywin Lannister.

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:13.844
I had served Aerys for nearly 20 years

00:00:13.845 --> 00:00:16.555
and as a result the realm had prospered.

00:00:16.556 --> 00:00:21.556
The royal coffers were full,
the land was at peace.

00:00:21.561 --> 00:00:24.771
But Aerys grew increasingly hostile -

00:00:24.772 --> 00:00:29.318
jealous of the success many credited to me.

00:00:29.319 --> 00:00:32.654
My power and influence unnerved him.

00:00:32.655 --> 00:00:35.532
The captain of my personal guard,
Ser llyn Payne,

00:00:35.533 --> 00:00:38.410
was once overheard
making offhand comments

00:00:38.411 --> 00:00:42.498
regarding who was 
the true ruler of Westeros.

00:00:42.499 --> 00:00:45.334
When the king was given this information,

00:00:45.335 --> 00:00:50.130
he had llyn Payne's tongue
ripped out with hot pincers.

00:00:50.131 --> 00:00:54.343
It was my desire to unite the Houses
of Lannister and Targaryen

00:00:54.344 --> 00:00:56.094
through marriage.

00:00:56.095 --> 00:01:01.095
My daughter, Cersei, would marry
Aerys' eldest son, Prince Rhaegar.

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:05.354
Such a union made perfect sense
for all parties.

00:01:05.355 --> 00:01:10.355
However, Aerys' senses had begun
to leave him quite some time earlier.

00:01:11.402 --> 00:01:16.402
Instead of uniting the royal family
with its most loyal and powerful ally,

00:01:16.783 --> 00:01:21.245
Aerys chose instead to insult my family,

00:01:21.246 --> 00:01:25.582
indicating that such a match
was beneath Rhaegar.

00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:30.583
Instead, he chose Elia Martell of Dorne
to be Rhaegar's wife.

00:01:31.172 --> 00:01:33.966
As if to rub salt in my wounds,

00:01:33.967 --> 00:01:38.470
Aerys appointed Jaime, my son,
to the Kingsguard.

00:01:38.471 --> 00:01:42.558
The Kingsguard may be an honor
for lesser families than ours,

00:01:42.559 --> 00:01:44.851
but it is a lifetime appointment

00:01:44.852 --> 00:01:49.606
that forces him to renounce
all family holdings.

00:01:49.607 --> 00:01:54.607
This creates a difficulty in naming an heir
to Casterly Rock.

00:01:55.905 --> 00:01:59.533
But Aerys knew all that.

00:01:59.534 --> 00:02:03.620
I had grown tired of the king's
constant provocation.

00:02:03.621 --> 00:02:07.291
Thus I resigned my post as Aerys' Hand

00:02:07.292 --> 00:02:09.710
and returned to Casterly Rock

00:02:09.711 --> 00:02:12.546
with my considerable forces.

00:02:12.547 --> 00:02:15.841
When Robert Baratheon rebelled
against the throne,

00:02:15.842 --> 00:02:19.136
Aerys grew fearful that I would
join with Robert's forces

00:02:19.137 --> 00:02:21.471
and rise against him.

00:02:21.472 --> 00:02:26.472
He thought himself clever, and 
kept Jaime very close, as if warning me.

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:32.520
He sunk deeper and deeper into delusion,
paranoia and violence.

00:02:33.109 --> 00:02:36.653
I've heard it said he became
obsessed with wildfire -

00:02:36.654 --> 00:02:41.325
a substance which, once lit,
cannot be extinguished.

00:02:41.326 --> 00:02:43.910
Convinced he had enemies all around him,

00:02:43.911 --> 00:02:46.955
he wouldn't allow blades in his presence,

00:02:46.956 --> 00:02:50.751
save for those of his Kingsguard.

00:02:50.752 --> 00:02:55.752
Alas, that proved to be his undoing.

